01C9                             ; The first page ends somewhere among the next four handlers, ] \ [ @ (they
01C9                             ; are in falling code order for this), and where exactly differs between the
01C9                             ; builds: NPG1 follows. Every handler below these four must start in the
01C9                             ; second page, and every one above in the first; chktab.py checks both.
01C9                             ; "]" returns: pop an address and jump to it. TOS is parked on the stack
01C9                             ; while rpop uses HL, and the drop at the end brings it back.
01C9   E5           H_RET:    PUSH   H   
