01D2                          DS   FAST,ANXT/256   
01D2                             ; "\" ( flag -- ): true skips to the next ")" or "]" at this level; ")"
01D2                             ; drops the block start, "]" returns. No closer at all ends the program.
01D2                             ; The flag stays in HL as the spent cell that rdrop and ret2 drop.
